cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "crowd-nav: anticipatory social navigation controller"
message: "If you use this software or the released models, please cite the paper below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Elmoghany
    given-names: Mohamed
repository-code: "https://github.com/elmoghany/crowd-nav"
url: "https://huggingface.co/elmoghany/crowd-nav"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A simulator-free social-navigation controller that predicts how each nearby pedestrian will
  respond to the robot's candidate plan, then selects the plan by optimization. Ships trained
  human-response models and a one-command install check.
